


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_bc8d7073:



    voice "RIN_1392"
    rin "「雨势，变得有点大了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_34c34871:


    "伦眺望窗外念叨了一句。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_75d043b4:



    voice "FUM_1220"
    fumi "「对不起啊，伦。还让你来陪我」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_752e5436:


    "文一边从风琴的谱架上拿起落下的乐谱，一边露出了愧疚的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_3b05f0c7:



    voice "RIN_1393"
    rin "「没事。稍微躲一会雨就会变小的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_01e8ad47:


    "这么说着伦转过身，从窗边回到风琴旁边。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_a8fe5163:



    voice "RIN_1394"
    rin "「今天的演奏辛苦你了。非常棒哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_ac688fbb:



    voice "FUM_1221"
    fumi "「谢谢。能让伦这么说，练习也算是有价值了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_4de16d50:



    voice "RIN_1395"
    rin "「我的话即使练习了也是不行的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_96ac5bd2:


    "这么说着伦随意地敲了几下键盘。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_2008a98a:


    "不和谐的音符在教堂里回响。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_520f8b18:



    voice "FUM_1222"
    fumi "「没有那种事哦。伦有音感，很快就能学会的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_f3f779bb:



    voice "RIN_1396"
    rin "「是这样吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_d3e1c0c7:


    "伦露出半信半疑的表情，坐在了椅子上。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5ff27af9:



    voice "FUM_1223"
    fumi "「嗯嗯。最开始把手指放在这里」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_0741b70c:



    voice "RIN_1397"
    rin "「诶……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_a4c35ccf:


    "伦照着文所说的把手指放在键盘上。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_3226258c:



    voice "FUM_1224"
    fumi "「哇，手指好长啊。可能比我还适合弹琴呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_ad6fc598:



    voice "RIN_1398"
    rin "「是，是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5c11bb24:



    voice "FUM_1225"
    fumi "「来，跟着我的手指弹一遍试试看」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_263cbc1c:


    "文绕过伦的背把手放上键盘，弹了一段简短的旋律。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_e9522bc5:



    voice "RIN_1399"
    rin "「……这样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_3956014e:


    "伦有样学样地也试着弹了弹。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_917580e5:



    voice "FUM_1226"
    fumi "「很好，很好♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_8c5b662c:


    "文把下巴顶在伦肩膀上，显得很开心。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_378596bc:



    voice "FUM_1227"
    fumi "「再稍微动动手指怎么样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_9b09eeb8:


    "这么说着文贴得更近了。胸部挤在伦的后背，微微变形。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_f5794beb:



    voice "RIN_1400"
    rin "「那个，胸碰到背了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_13c0ec86:



    voice "FUM_1228"
    fumi "「啊，对不起。很闷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_e08e7eca:



    voice "RIN_1401"
    rin "「没有，不如说很舒服。怎么说呢，感觉有点奇怪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_336ae64b:


    "伦把头扭过去，调皮地亲了下文的脸颊。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_4960dc71:



    voice "FUM_1229"
    fumi "「真是的，还不是怪伦，很快就往那方面想了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_24246ff3:



    voice "RIN_1402"
    rin "「对不起……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_219b10e8:



    voice "FUM_1230"
    fumi "「嗯嗯……等下……嗯啾」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5c01892c:


    "伦一边道歉一边夺走了她的双唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_337f09bc:


    "责备的过程中文也不再拒绝，转眼之间便舌头交缠，响起粘稠的水声。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_896bd722:


    "在无数次共享呼吸的过程中，互相凝视的瞳孔变得湿润。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_afd1f64a:



    voice "RIN_1403"
    rin "「竟然在这种地方发情，我们也真是有够冒渎神明了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_953fd9f7:



    voice "FUM_1231"
    fumi "「是啊……天使要生气了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_1a534c18:



    voice "RIN_1404"
    rin "「那么，到此为止吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5ef95569:



    voice "FUM_1232"
    fumi "「哎呀，伦能停下来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_ccc0b85a:


    "两人看着对方，脸上浮现出了恶作剧般的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_567269f4:



    voice "RIN_1405"
    rin "「我怎么可能停得下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_23445198:



    voice "FUM_1233"
    fumi "「我也……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_a403b4f3:


    "然后两人再度交换了浓厚的吻。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_23a43370:



    voice "RIN_1406"
    rin "「文……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_ef0b70b5:


    "为了面朝她伦从椅子上起来想转个身，但是……"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_6991b59d:



    voice "FUM_1234"
    fumi "「不行」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_7d760cc4:


    "文的手温柔地压住了她的背。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_57f32cc9:



    voice "RIN_1407"
    rin "「哎？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5fccb947:


    "伦的胸部撞到了键盘，发出了不和谐的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_30326120:



    voice "RIN_1408"
    rin "「什么？文，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_81a25a58:


    "伦露出一脸不解的表情回过头。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_7901dc36:



    voice "FUM_1235"
    fumi "「嗯哼哼，稍微玩一玩吧♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_02b6723a:


    "文面带着奇妙的笑容，俯视着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_bf908ca3:



    voice "RIN_1409"
    rin "「……玩，玩什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_db8a64e9:


    "伦的声音明显表现出了不安。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_5bb50247:


    "有了之前的经验，伦很清楚，文露出这副笑容的时候肯定有所企图。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_07_278c7e29:


    "………………"


